# Environment Variables

- Add new variables to `src/config/env.ts` and consume the exported `env` object everywhere else.
- Client variables must use the `VITE_` prefix.
- Only add defaults for values that are safe to omit during local development.
- Do not read `import.meta.env` directly in application code.
